  "bodyHash": "fb5af463f545e8f4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jMvJaKO.png\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/supported/paper_vector.svg\" alt=\"paper\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/supported/purpur_vector.svg\" alt=\"purpur\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/supported/spigot_vector.svg\" alt=\"spigot\"></p>\n<h2>ClickMobs</h2>\n<p><strong>ClickMobs 是一款簡單的便捷模組／外掛程式，可讓您將任何生物收入背包並隨身攜帶。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zUetzp3Gzk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>透過按住 <strong>Shift 鍵並右鍵點擊</strong> 來將生物收入背包。</li>\n<li>放置生物頭即可將其放回世界。\n<ul>\n<li>可將生物直接放入船、礦車等載具中。</li>\n<li>使用發射器可自動重新生成生物。（適用於 Paper/Spigot 1.21+）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>提供簡潔的提示訊息、音效與粒子特效。</li>\n<li>高度可自訂設定。\n<ul>\n<li>預設情況下無法拾取敵對生物。</li>\n<li>可自由將任意生物加入黑名單或白名單。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>語言支援：</strong>德文與英文（僅限 Paper/Spigot）</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
